---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
	<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8 py-32 bg-slate-50">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="text-slate-500 mb-12">Last updated: October 24, 2024</p>

		<div class="space-y-8 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
				<p>At RMG Technologies, we collect information to provide better services to our enterprise clients. We collect information in the following ways:</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-4 space-y-2 text-slate-600">
					<li><strong>Information you give us:</strong> When you create an account, we collect personal information such as your name, company, email address, and phone number.</li>
					<li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> We collect telemetry data regarding how our APIs and dashboards are accessed to ensure system stability and prevent fraud.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">2. How We Use Information</h2>
				<p>We use the information we collect to operate, maintain, and improve our high-stakes software systems. We do not sell your personal data to third parties. All data is processed in compliance with global financial and defense data regulations.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">3. Data Security</h2>
				<p>We implement military-grade AES-256 encryption for data at rest and TLS 1.3 for data in transit. Our infrastructure is distributed across multiple availability zones to ensure zero data loss.</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>